<p>Keep writing. Note. He repeats every fragment.</p>
<p>Whether it is checked or unchecked, every exception occurs at runtime only. There is no chance of occurring any exception at compile time.</p>
<p>Point number one is clear.</p>
<pre class='code'>class Note1EveryExceptionAtRuntime {
