<p>Handling error is my responsibility? No. I’m not responsible for that. These are due to lack of system resources. Being a programmer, what I can do? It’s not my job. It’s not my responsibility.</p>
<p>That’s why these are checked or unchecked? Unchecked. Compiler should not ask how you can handle the error.</p>
<pre class='code'>class CompilerMustNotAskAboutError {
